            "text": "<p><strong>Auracast broadcast audio</strong> is a revolutionary new Bluetooth capability that enables one-to-many audio broadcasting. Unlike traditional Bluetooth which creates a one-to-one connection, Auracast allows a single transmitter to broadcast audio to an unlimited number of compatible receivers - headphones, earbuds, speakers, and hearing aids.</p><p>Built on <strong>Bluetooth LE Audio</strong> and the advanced <strong>LC3 codec</strong>, Auracast delivers superior audio quality with ultra-low latency, making it perfect for TV watching, public venues, and shared listening experiences.</p>"
