            "text": "<h4>Home Entertainment</h4><p>Watch TV with family members each using their own headphones at their preferred volume. Auracast eliminates lip-sync issues, making it perfect for late-night viewing without disturbing others.</p><h4>Public Venues</h4><p>Airports, gyms, hospitals, and conference rooms can broadcast audio directly to visitors' headphones. No pairing, no hassle - just tune in and listen.</p><h4>Assistive Listening</h4><p>Auracast is the next generation of assistive listening technology, replacing outdated hearing loops with a standardized, high-quality wireless solution for those with hearing difficulties.</p><h4>Shared Audio Experiences</h4><p>Share music with friends by broadcasting from your phone. Everyone nearby with compatible headphones can tune in and listen together.</p>"
